{
 "_": "Jensen reel («Хиймэл оюун ганц хүнээс хамаарч болох уу?»). Edit this file, then run npm run build:jensen-reel (writes cues.json + stems; add -- --short for the 90-second cut, which lays out only the beats in 'short'). 'from' is seconds in the original YouTube video. A beat lasts lead + pre + voice + post (or 'hold'); its cuts share that time in proportion to 'len', so keep each share inside its camera shot. Every cut is framed by x (source pixel at the panel's centre, default 960), zoom (1 = a 4:5 crop filling the panel; under 1 shows more of the frame on black, for cards and pages) and cy. \"mute\": true plays no film sound (b-roll that carries Bloomberg's narration or music). era: oct | nov is the timeline tag; score names the music preset; turn is the beat that gets the riser and hit.",
